    project: exec-sim-repair-verifier
    status: done
    review_mode: full
    review_visible: true
    writing_visible: true
    venue: ''
    focus: 评估加入 re-repair downstream utility section 后论文的整体说服力。重点关注：(1) re-repair
      结果是否能有效回应 'no downstream utility' reviewer concern, (2) 即使 re-repair 是 moderate
      positive (+5-10pp) 而非 strong positive，论文整体是否足够, (3) 如果 re-repair negative，论文是否仍可投稿
    what_if:
    - name: re-repair-phase1-instruct
      claim: 'Downstream Utility: Diagnostic-Guided Re-repair'
      description: 'Re-repair experiment with fixed confounds: Qwen3-8B-Instruct on
        50-80 SWE-bench Verified instances. 5 conditions (A1-minimal control, A2-test-names-only,
        B-CLS-diagnostic, C-oracle-diagnostic, D-random). Docker-based resolve rate
        eval (pass@1, pass@5). Paired design. Two prompt formats for robustness. Expected
        outcome: CLS-diagnostic (B) improves resolve rate by 5-15pp over A1/A2; Oracle
        (C) as upper bound; Random (D) as lower bound.'
      estimated_gpu_hours: 0.0
